 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 9.644750006993613,
   "end": 15.092873206582091,
   "text": "Every business needs a bookkeeper, a sales assistant and someone to plan the rota."
  },
  {
   "start": 15.142873206582092,
   "end": 20.456895840326947,
   "text": "AgentGig gives you AI agents for those jobs, paid per task, working as one team."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.906895840326946,
   "end": 28.11461526673387,
   "text": "This is Sam, who runs Café Lumen, a coffee roaster supplying offices in Manchester."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.164615266733872,
   "end": 33.467604173660284,
   "text": "Sam's team has six agents, a token balance and a memory they all share."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.91760417366028,
   "end": 38.25643141725003,
   "text": "Every agent works from the business itself:"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.306431417250025,
   "end": 42.90621763519874,
   "text": "its profile, its documents, and facts the team has learned."
  },
  {
   "start": 42.95621763519874,
   "end": 45.743375327506435,
   "text": "Sam uploads the catering price list."
  },
  {
   "start": 45.79337532750643,
   "end": 50.23554167366028,
   "text": "Cloud DLP removes personal data before any model sees it."
  },
  {
   "start": 51.68554167366028,
   "end": 52.68953356297326,
   "text": "Need a new skill?"
  },
  {
   "start": 52.73953356297326,
   "end": 53.18552974617937,
   "text": "Hire it."
  },
  {
   "start": 53.23552974617937,
   "end": 55.54151161640838,
   "text": "Quote Builder costs two tokens a task."
  },
  {
   "start": 55.591511616408376,
   "end": 59.757479173660286,
   "text": "Sam lets it read the price list and caps its spending for the month."
  },
  {
   "start": 65.2515416584015,
   "end": 67.86015152387235,
   "text": "Two supplier invoices land in the inbox."
  },
  {
   "start": 67.91015152387234,
   "end": 72.64564928171988,
   "text": "A Cloud Storage event wakes ReceiptHero through Pub/Sub and Cloud Tasks."
  },
  {
   "start": 72.69564928171988,
   "end": 76.16830735346876,
   "text": "Gemini reads each invoice, and code checks every sum."
  },
  {
   "start": 76.21830735346876,
   "end": 80.0232916584015,
   "text": "One supplier has overcharged by thirty-eight pounds forty."
  },
  {
   "start": 81.4732916584015,
   "end": 84.8301828429745,
   "text": "Sam is out, so the draft comes to Telegram."
  },
  {
   "start": 84.88018284297449,
   "end": 85.46402306336017,
   "text": "One tap:"
  },
  {
   "start": 85.51402306336017,
   "end": 91.01012499173483,
   "text": "it's logged to the spend sheet, and a correction email waits in Gmail."
  },
  {
   "start": 99.22729160690308,
   "end": 102.85831527418249,
   "text": "Sam asks Ada, the team lead, for the VAT summary."
  },
  {
   "start": 102.90831527418248,
   "end": 108.86814983300602,
   "text": "Ada hands it to VAT Reconciler, an agent from another company on its own server."
  },
  {
   "start": 108.91814983300601,
   "end": 114.50236973190307,
   "text": "It receives the audited invoices over the A2A protocol, never Sam's logins."
  },
  {
   "start": 114.55236973190307,
   "end": 119.61072910690308,
   "text": "Seventy pounds to reclaim, and the overcharged invoice is held back."
  },
  {
   "start": 121.06072910690308,
   "end": 124.6986004761977,
   "text": "A customer wants coffee and pastries for forty people."
  },
  {
   "start": 124.7486004761977,
   "end": 131.5279919008173,
   "text": "Quote Builder prices every line from Sam's own list, adds VAT, and saves the quote as a Gmail draft."
  },
  {
   "start": 131.57799190081732,
   "end": 137.4695624402364,
   "text": "Sam adds a note about vegan guests, and Ada saves it to company memory for every agent."
  },
  {
   "start": 153.59306248092653,
   "end": 155.38993357467652,
   "text": "A two-star review comes in."
  },
  {
   "start": 155.43993357467653,
   "end": 158.74166259666725,
   "text": "ReviewPulse drafts a reply in Café Lumen's voice."
  },
  {
   "start": 158.79166259666727,
   "end": 160.72533895662096,
   "text": "Sam rewrites it and approves."
  },
  {
   "start": 160.77533895662097,
   "end": 163.39304164759318,
   "text": "Nothing goes out without a person's OK."
  },
  {
   "start": 176.3620625343323,
   "end": 183.32045836766562,
   "text": "Back at the desk, RotaBuilder plans next week, and code checks every shift against availability and hours."
  },
  {
   "start": 191.35272924168908,
   "end": 194.88727268140536,
   "text": "Everything the team did today cost eighteen tokens."
  },
  {
   "start": 194.93727268140537,
   "end": 199.80723426532973,
   "text": "Tokens are held when work starts and charged only when it's delivered."
  },
  {
   "start": 199.85723426532974,
   "end": 201.2129375750224,
   "text": "Failed work is free."
  },
  {
   "start": 205.95172913932802,
   "end": 219.72200314726453,
   "text": "Under the hood, one gateway on Cloud Run runs every task through verify, reserve, scrub, ground, run and deliver, with Gemini on Vertex AI, Firestore and Memory Bank."
  },
  {
   "start": 219.77200314726454,
   "end": 220.47129511155023,
   "text": "AgentGig:"
  },
  {
   "start": 220.52129511155024,
   "end": 223.38520830599467,
   "text": "AI employees that work as one team."
  }
 ],
 "callouts": [
